desc:
This unit is available now.

If you are interested, please note that 
- we appreciate replies from all applicants, but 
- only those with the complete info requested will be replied.

Family Oriented Beautiful Condo. 
Quiet, Green, Convenient, Cozy...... 

Gorgeous 2BR/2BT Spacious 3rd (top) floor unit, oversized windows,

- In the heart of Guildford, north facing view of the mountains;
- 1050 Sqft. spacious open plan, high ceiling;
- 2 bedrooms and 2 full bathrooms, laminate flooring throughout;
- stainless steel appliances, granite counter tops;
- insuite laundry and a very private deck;
- a good size locker room and comes with one parking;
- hot tub and sauna;
- bike room;
- gym and clubhouse facilities in the building. 

- $2,395/Month (utilities extra).
- one year lease.
- Credit / reference required.
- Tenant insurance required.
- one cat allowed. No smoking.

Please apply only through email, with the following info:
- number of tenants and pets; 
- brief employment info;
- reason for moving;
- move in date;
- other specific info, if any.
